      "message": "Disclaimer: I\u0027m not sure how easy it is going to be to have the system libraries be used with Bazel. It\u0027s a secondary priority for me at the moment, because of that uncertainty.\n\nWhat I\u0027m hearing is that I should be moving third_party includes to use \u003c\u003e, not \"\", right? My cursory look at the existing codebase is that more use the latter not the former. I don\u0027t particularly care in either case, and can modify gazelle to not care much either, but we should pick one.",
